    schema1:description "Development of a copper‑free Ullmann‑type etherification to couple bis(2,3,4,5‑tetrafluorophenyl) ether from 4‑(4‑fluorophenyl)‑3,6‑dihydro‑2h‑thieno[3,2,1‑ij]quinolin‑8‑one precursors using a cyclobutyl‑palladium complex as catalyst." ;
