    schema1:name "Synthesis‑BisTetraFluoroPhenylEther‑2025" ;
    schema1:text "A sustainable protocol replaces copper with a cyclobutyl‑palladium complex, delivering high yields (≥85 %) under mild conditions. Reaction mechanistic studies suggest a Pd(II)/Pd(0) catalytic cycle." ;
