    schema1:text "Under a 0.2 T magnetic field, the reaction gave 1,4‑bis(trifluoromethyl)benzene in 64 % yield, a 12 % increase relative to a zero‑field control, indicating field‑induced alignment of the sulfone intermediate." ;
