    schema1:datePublished "2025-12-20T14:45:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema1:description "Evaluation of how the nuclear spin of palladium isotopes (¹⁰⁶Pd vs. ¹⁰⁸Pd) influences the rate of a cyclobutyl‑palladium complex mediated cross‑coupling with 1,4‑bis(3,5‑di‑tert‑butyl‑4‑hydroxyphenyl)butane. The experiment uses time‑resolved ^1H NMR kinetic monitoring under identical conditions, comparing the two isotopically enriched catalysts." ;
