    schema1:description "Development of a scalable palladium‑mediated C–N bond formation to prepare 4-(2‑hydroxyethyl)morpholine from tetrafluoroethylbenzene and bis(2,3,4,5-tetrafluorophenyl) ether. Reaction optimization focuses on catalyst loading, base choice, and temperature." ;
