    schema1:name "Pd‑Catalyzed Cross‑Coupling Synthesis of 4-(2‑hydroxyethyl)morpholine" ;
    schema1:text "A high‑yielding protocol for synthesizing 4-(2‑hydroxyethyl)morpholine using a fluorinated aryl electrophile and a palladium catalyst. The method tolerates moisture and delivers > 90 % isolated yield." ;
