    schema1:datePublished "2025-12-10T09:30:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    schema1:description "The experiment probes how an external static magnetic field influences the intersystem crossing rate of a photo‑generated radical pair consisting of (e)-1,2‑difluoro‑3‑tert‑butyl‑prop‑2‑en‑1‑yl nitroxide and tetrafluoroethylbenzene. Continuous‑wave X‑band EPR spectroscopy is used to monitor the singlet‑triplet dynamics under varying field strengths." ;
