    schema1:description "A single‑vessel, high‑yield protocol for coupling tetrafluoroethylbenzene with a cyclobutyl‑palladium complex to afford bis(2,3,4,5‑tetrafluorophenyl) ether under microwave heating. The study evaluates ligand effects of 4-(bis(tert‑butyl)amino)phenylacetylene." ;
