    schema1:text "The reaction proceeds via oxidative addition of the cyclobutyl‑palladium complex to tetrafluoroethylbenzene, followed by reductive elimination to form the diaryl ether. Microwave irradiation reduces the reaction time from 12 h to 45 min." ;
