    rdfs:label "¹H NMR (CDCl₃, 400 MHz) measurement" ;
    hypmol:measurementMethod "¹H NMR (CDCl₃, 400 MHz)" ;
    hypmol:measurementResult "Signal at δ = 7.85 ppm (s, 1H, aromatic) and carbonyl carbon at δ = 199 ppm in ¹³C NMR, confirming ketone formation." .

