    rdfs:label "Time‑resolved EPR measurement" ;
    hypmol:measurementMethod "Time‑resolved EPR" ;
    hypmol:measurementResult "Triplet signal intensity decreased from 1.00 a.u. (0 T) to 0.68 a.u. (0.5 T); kinetic fit gave a singlet‑triplet interconversion rate k_ST = 3.2×10⁷ s⁻¹ at 0 T." .

