<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/00d34bad-de0b-4287-b548-9a306c3cde96> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Charge a 250 mL flask with 1.00 g (3.2 mmol) of 1,4-dichloro-2,5-dimethyl-3-hexynyl (z)-prop-2-enoate, 0.70 g (2.4 mmol) of tetrafluoroethylbenzene, and 0.05 g (0.12 mmol) of Pd₂(dba)₃ under argon." ;
