    rdfs:label "Add tetrafluoroethylbenzene (0.10 mol, 12.4 g) and 2,2‑dimethyl‑1,3‑dioxolane (0.12 mol, 10.5 mL) to the flask under nitrogen, then heat to 80 °C for 6 h." ;
