<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/047ebe40-e747-4fc3-b72e-e96792f065d9> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "In a nitrogen‑filled Schlenk tube, dissolve 1‑(4‑methylphenyl)ethan‑1‑one (0.080 mol, 10.2 g) and 1‑ethyl‑3‑(2‑thienyl)pyrrolidin‑3‑yl acetate (0.080 mol, 13.0 g) in dry toluene (50 mL)." ;
