<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/05784bc6-2375-4a38-a8bd-1c411ad94f3f> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Dissolve 0.050 g (e)-1,2‑difluoro‑3‑tert‑butyl‑prop‑2‑en‑1‑yl nitroxide and 0.120 g tetrafluoroethylbenzene in 2 mL 1,4‑dithiabicyclo[4.4.0]decane‑2,9‑diyl bis(trifluoromethanesulfonyl)imide to give a clear solution." ;
