    rdfs:label "Dissolve 0.150 g (0.85 mmol) of tetrafluoroethylbenzene and 0.120 g (0.50 mmol) of 1,4-bis(trifluoromethyl)benzene in 30 mL of dry cyclohexane under nitrogen." ;
