    rdfs:label "In the glovebox, dissolve 0.080 g (0.22 mmol) cyclobutyl‑palladium complex and 0.045 g (0.18 mmol) tetrasulfur ditelluride in 8 mL dry THF; add 0.10 mL (0.20 mmol) of 1,4‑bis(trifluoromethyl)benzene as internal standard." ;
