<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/31af3de1-4042-4926-ade0-067175c27f74> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Add 0.120 g (0.45 mmol) tris(2‑amino‑3,4,5‑trimethylphenyl)methane and 0.089 g (0.30 mmol) bis(4‑(trifluoromethyl)phenyl)disulfide, stir until fully dissolved." ;
