<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/31b05904-4721-443f-9ab5-0fceceac9821> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Repeat the laser excitation and EPR acquisition at static magnetic fields of 20 mT, 50 mT, and 80 mT, allowing 10 min equilibration at each field." ;
