<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/32334284-5f59-4069-b9c7-9b73d39d2721> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Allow the reaction to warm to 120 °C and stir for 6 h. Monitor conversion every hour by withdrawing 0.2 mL aliquots, quenching with water, and analysing by GC‑FID." ;
