<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/32422af2-daac-4a52-8179-babee1b2c0a2> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Repeated the measurement at magnetic fields of 0.2 T, 0.5 T and 0.8 T, adjusting the field controller each time." ;
