<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/330b05b3-99b2-40fb-8647-998b28c065c0> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Excite the sample at 400 nm (pump, 100 fs) and record transient absorption from 350‑800 nm (probe) with a temporal window of –0.5 ps to 5 ns over 200 delay steps." ;
