<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/335759ba-7f46-445e-bb2a-8d4c777095a5> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Oxidize 2.0 g (0.006 mol) of the thioether in 50 mL MeOH with 0.5 g (0.006 mol) of Na₂CO₃ under air at 25 °C for 12 h." ;
