<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/68beb1c5-beeb-443a-9b60-ca5adbd94e94> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Purge the reaction vessel with nitrogen for 15 min, then heat to 130 °C under reflux for 12 h while stirring at 600 rpm." ;
