<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/68ccbd55-b826-4978-8ac9-ccf7cc94a013> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Cool to 25 °C, filter through Celite, wash the residue with ethyl acetate (3 × 20 mL)." ;
