<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/68e6eee3-f555-461f-8b90-f51680be858b> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Dissolve 0.30 g (0.85 mmol) bis(4‑(trifluoromethyl)phenyl)disulfide and 0.10 g (0.84 mmol) 4‑(2‑hydroxyethyl)morpholine in 5 mL dry acetonitrile under nitrogen." ;
