<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/692196b6-a3ee-496d-a1eb-2278042d04e9> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Perform the same set of measurements in acetonitrile (polar solvent) using identical concentrations." ;
