<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/6987a2e4-9733-4038-8cfc-0dc6830d99bd> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Seal the flask, remove from glovebox, and irradiate with 365 nm UV light while maintaining 0 °C with an ice bath for 2 h." ;
