<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/69fdfcad-5200-43c6-b708-c0ed4220caaf> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Added 4‑(2‑hydroxyethyl)‑morpholine (2.10 g, 18.2 mmol) and potassium carbonate (5.04 g, 36.5 mmol) under nitrogen, then heated to 110 °C for 6 h." ;
