<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/6a965702-7e90-4fca-bb91-7ea1d07933cb> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Charge the reactor with bis(4‑dimethylamino‑2‑methylphenyl) sulfone (4.0 g, 12 mmol) and tris(2,6‑diisopropylphenyl)borane (2.5 g, 8 mmol)." ;
