<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/6a96a31c-b129-4397-a67c-74446996e50a> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Add tetrafluoroethylbenzene (2.16 g, 10 mmol) and 1,4‑bis(trifluoromethyl)benzene (2.44 g, 10 mmol) via syringe under N₂." ;
