<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/6d060a88-c185-4eab-98dc-a969eb55a581> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Dissolve 0.150 g of (e)-1,2‑difluoro‑3‑tert‑butyl‑prop‑2‑en‑1‑yl nitroxide and 0.050 g of tetraethylammonium 4-(dimethylamino)benzoate in the acetonitrile, stir for 5 min to obtain a homogeneous orange solution." ;
