    rdfs:label "Transfer the solution into a quartz cuvette under N₂, seal, and place in the EPR cavity. Apply static magnetic fields of 0 mT, 50 mT, 100 mT, and 150 mT sequentially, recording the transient EPR signal after a 532 nm laser flash (5 ns, 10 mJ)." ;
