<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/990fc929-7553-4b3d-b7d0-b2ae61dae6c9> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Transferred 0.5 mL of the solution into a quartz EPR tube, flash‑frozen in liquid nitrogen, and mounted in the cryostat at 80 K." ;
