<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/99c610f0-7335-4bc0-99d7-d98615758519> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Charge a 80 mL Schlenk flask with tetrafluoroethylbenzene (1.20 g, 5.0 mmol) and 4‑[(e)‑3‑(n,n‑diethylamino)prop‑2‑en‑1‑yl]benzenesulfonamide (1.45 g, 5.0 mmol). Add 30 mL of anhydrous MeCN." ;
