<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/99d5c42d-2535-4e4a-afd4-47ad1028f349> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Added tetrafluoroethylbenzene (2.1 g, 12 mmol) and potassium carbonate (2.1 g, 15 mmol) to the mixture, then introduced a magnetic stir bar." ;
