    rdfs:label "Prepare 5 mL of degassed acetonitrile solution containing 0.02 M bis(trifluoromethyl)hydrazine and 0.015 M 4-(4‑fluorophenyl)-3,6-dihydro‑2h‑thieno[3,2,1‑ij]quinolin‑8-one." ;
