<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/a8597b50-572b-4cac-9857-32ad5d5981db> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Illuminate the cuvette with the 355 nm LED flashlamp for 30 s while applying a 0 mT field; record the initial EPR signal (baseline)." ;
