<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/aa21428e-c399-4b78-a551-d74fc23469e3> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Place the cuvette in the EPR resonator, set magnetic field to 0 mT, and fire the laser (10 ns pulse, 1 mJ). Record the transient EPR signal for 5 µs." ;
