<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/aa404d44-c77a-4414-8dec-c51c9b3caec8> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "After irradiation (total 30 min), quench the reaction with 1 mL of 0.1 M aqueous HCl, extract with ethyl acetate, dry, and analyze the isolated product by chiral HPLC." ;
