    rdfs:label "Charge the flask with 0.70 g (2.0 mmol) of bis(2,3,4,5‑tetrafluorophenyl) bromide, 0.30 g (2.5 mmol) of 4-(2‑hydroxyethyl)morpholine, 0.02 g (0.05 mmol) of cyclobutyl‑palladium complex, and 0.10 g (0.5 mmol) of tri‑tert‑butylphosphine." ;
