    rdfs:label "In a dry 100 mL flask under N₂, combine cyclobutyl‑palladium complex (0.45 g, 0.75 mmol), 4‑(4‑fluorophenyl)-3,6‑dihydro‑2H‑thieno[3,2,1‑ij]quinolin‑8‑one (0.30 g, 0.85 mmol), and 4‑(2‑hydroxyethyl)morpholine (0.12 g, 0.95 mmol)." ;
