<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/c617db25-aec2-47b3-b418-e98eb430d747> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Fire the 355 nm laser pulse (5 ns, 0.5 mJ) into the sample while recording the TREPR signal at 9.5 GHz with a 10 ns time resolution." ;
