<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/d857b7e2-ae87-4156-93fe-4d5260568872> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Repeat the irradiation while applying magnetic fields of 0 T, 0.1 T, and 0.3 T using Helmholtz coils." ;
