<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/d88b628c-0782-4659-abc2-fefef98b1930> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Charge a 50 mL flask with 1.00 g (3.20 mmol) of 1,4‑dichloro‑2,5‑dimethyl‑3‑hexynyl (z)‑prop‑2‑enoate, 0.045 g (0.16 mmol) Pd(PPh₃)₄, 0.080 g (0.16 mmol) X‑Phos and 15 mL dry THF under N₂." ;
