<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/d8a3c2dc-7b18-4c78-b927-1e5c736a6be7> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Cool to rt, dilute with ethyl acetate (100 mL), wash successively with water (2 × 50 mL) and brine (1 × 50 mL). Dry over Na₂SO₄ and concentrate." ;
