<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/d92126e4-2c7d-486e-a761-1efb11ee1226> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Introduce 0.045 g (0.24 mmol) of (e)-1,2‑difluoro‑3‑tert‑butyl‑prop‑2‑en‑1‑yl nitroxide, vortex for 10 s." ;
