<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/d9752b4d-f463-494e-8d14-e71f7bcc66df> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "Cool the sample to 10 K in the EPR spectrometer to observe the radical intermediate before relaxation." ;
