<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/dd94abe4-4cec-4064-bb1d-409147fb76dc> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    rdfs:label "In a dry Schlenk tube, dissolve 4‑(2‑hydroxyethyl)morpholine (2.0 g, 13.0 mmol) and bis(4‑dimethylamino‑2‑methylphenyl) sulfone (3.6 g, 9.6 mmol) in dry acetonitrile (30 mL)." ;
